WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:17.113
Miss Gray: Please sit down, everyone.

2
00:00:17.114 --> 00:00:22.196
Daisy: I'm ready, Miss Gray.

3
00:00:22.197 --> 00:00:25.499
Miss Gray: What a pretty necklace, Daisy.

4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.486
Daisy: Thanks. We made jewelry at my party.

5
00:00:30.487 --> 00:00:36.358
Daisy: And I wanted a necklace like yours.

6
00:00:36.359 --> 00:00:39.212
Kara: I wasn't invited to the party.

7
00:00:39.213 --> 00:00:41.836
Daisy: What?

8
00:00:41.837 --> 00:00:47.710
Kara: Never mind.

9
00:00:47.711 --> 00:00:51.340
Kara: What are we doing today, Miss Gray?

10
00:00:51.341 --> 00:00:53.474
Miss Gray: Something fun.

11
00:00:53.474 --> 00:00:57.793
I'll explain soon.

12
00:00:57.794 --> 00:01:00.127
Miss Gray: Okay, everyone.

13
00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:02.748
We've been talking about maps this week.

14
00:01:02.749 --> 00:01:07.473
Miss Gray: So today we're going to make our own maps.

15
00:01:07.474 --> 00:01:11.159
Coby: Are we going on a trip?

16
00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:12.487
Miss Gray: Sort of.

17
00:01:12.487 --> 00:01:16.024
We're going outside to make maps of the playground.

18
00:01:16.025 --> 00:01:19.027
Miss Gray: First, draw a map of the playground.

19
00:01:19.028 --> 00:01:24.250
Miss Gray: Then, add five landmarks, like the slide or the fence.

20
00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:30.913
Miss Gray: Now, find a partner and line up!

21
00:01:30.914 --> 00:01:34.358
Daisy: Jenna! Let's be partners!

22
00:01:34.359 --> 00:01:37.082
Miss Gray: Daisy and Kara, come here please.

23
00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:40.441
Miss Gray: I'd like you two to work together today.

24
00:01:40.442 --> 00:01:42.292
Kara and Daisy: What?

25
00:01:42.293 --> 00:01:44.756
Miss Gray: You'll make a great team.

26
00:01:44.757 --> 00:01:52.707
Miss Gray: Remember, your map must show five landmarks.

27
00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:56.002
Mark: Hey, Coby, let's draw the slide!

28
00:01:56.003 --> 00:02:00.149
Coby: Okay. And don't forget the basketball hoop!

29
00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:02.498
Jenna: We put the garden on our map.

30
00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:08.566
Maya: And the brick path.

31
00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:12.080
Kara: Daisy! What are you doing?

32
00:02:12.081 --> 00:02:15.477
Kara: Miss Gray said we need five landmarks on our map.

33
00:02:15.478 --> 00:02:18.150
Kara: And we only have one so far!

34
00:02:18.151 --> 00:02:21.239
Daisy: I'm looking for something.

35
00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.846
Kara: What? What are you looking for?

36
00:02:23.847 --> 00:02:31.341
Daisy: My necklace. It's gone!
